    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the labor law, in relation to requiring contractors and\nsubcontractors performing construction work for covered renewable energy\nsystems to use apprenticeship agreements",
    "basePrintNo": "S4881",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S4881-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
